Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好个种马  你头壳硬命大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the Stallion. You got the Gold Star, Stallion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:47.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太好运  简直是奇迹出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lucky, so lucky! What you did was a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:49.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是世上最幸运的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the luckiest man on the earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看起来像吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I look lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:53.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有人能跟我对抗得这么久的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, nobody goes the distance with me!
