Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:08:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是否因为玲声救了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you were going down, did the bell save you, Apollo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.79,0:09:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玲声不算什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bell nothing, man! I can beat that chump!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我随时可以把那个呆子打倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'll fight him anyplace, anytime!
