Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.79,0:09:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以  任何地点  任何时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said anyplace, anytime, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:09.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗  可是你说过不再比赛的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo, you said no rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:10.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呆子  你听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, chump,
