Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.80,0:09:23.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他精力充足  你没什么好证明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sure has a lot of energy. You know, you got nothing to prove.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.80,0:09:26.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不在乎裁判的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care what the hell them judges said.
