Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:34.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得再跟我比赛  呆子  回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna fight me again, chump. Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.81,0:09:37.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  你最好先回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian, you better go home
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:40.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能要留在这一会儿接受治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I'm gonna be busy healing here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.82,0:09:42.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你最跟保罗回家 睡个觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, maybe you better go home with Paulie and get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我爱你  - 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I love you.  - I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.82,0:09:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you later.
