Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直希望的  你们该看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always wanted to be. You should've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.85,0:10:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在第十回就把他给制服 到了第15回合他便告不知了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had him in the 10th and in the 15th, he was gone.
