Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.86,0:10:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  帮个小忙.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, I got a little favor I'd like to ask you.
