Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  等我这治疗工作一结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, as soon as l get finished, you know, healing here
