Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:07.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吗?  很感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}okay? I'd appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:10.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里作什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.88,0:11:15.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,访客时间已过  你得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Visiting hours are over. I have to ask you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.88,0:11:19.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回头见  保罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, l'll see you later, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.89,0:11:21.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都以你为荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Everybody's proud of you, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗?  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah?  - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.89,0:11:24.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今晚觉得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l feel good tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.89,0:11:29.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀 你看起来是很好 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, ya look good. Let's go.
