Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.89,0:11:37.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.90,0:11:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,味道不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That tastes good.
