Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.94,0:12:37.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是否尽了全力在比赛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you gimme your best?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.95,0:12:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.94,0:12:47.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.95,0:12:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,年近了  你还好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This coming year, Rocky You all right?
