Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:17.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石膏一旦拆掉 你想要多敏捷就有多敏捷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think how fast you'll be when you get it off.
