Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:37.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们是很健忘的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People kinda forget, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.99,0:13:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把握现在  这里签个字吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The time is now. Here, sign it here.
