Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.99,0:13:53.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会跟你谈的  给我电话号码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll talk to you or something. Where will we call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.99,0:13:58.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会打电话给你  你的电话几号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'll call you. You got a number?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:00.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我打给你好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, l'll just call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  你打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. You call. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.00,0:14:06.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙脑袋有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy's got brain damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.01,0:14:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够出院又不要吃药真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great being out of the hospital, not having to take all those pills and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.01,0:14:14.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我的腿好痛呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My legs were getting so sore and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.01,0:14:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只要卧在那里  觉得萎缩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From just laying there, I was kinda shrinking and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:22.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能出院真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great to be outside, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:25.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来动物园作什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we doing here at the zoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.01,0:14:27.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很喜欢这个动物园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I kinda like this zoo a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:29.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一个很特出的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a special place,
