Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢动物园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.03,0:14:41.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, me too.
