Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你未来的四五十年有什么打算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what do you think you're doing for like the next 40 or 50 years?
