Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你嫁给我应该不会很不爽吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you wouldn't mind marrying me very much.
