Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.07,0:15:46.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要来参加婚礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna come?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.07,0:15:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你周末能出来吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you get out for the weekend?
