Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.11,0:16:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神父  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.11,0:16:48.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你主持得很好  我以此为荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you done real good. I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.12,0:16:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜  艾莉和洛奇  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian and Rocky, congratulations!
