Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.13,0:17:20.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米奇  回头见  谢谢你来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you around. Thanks for coming.
