Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.14,0:17:31.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你上次的拳赛净挣多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much money did you make from your last fight?How much did you clear?
