Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.15,0:17:35.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道税很重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l know taxes kill you. What you wanna do with your money now?
