Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:41.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也为你高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, and I'm happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:44.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投资公寓大厦比较安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's about investing in condominiums? It's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.16,0:17:46.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公寓大厦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Condominiums?
