Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.19,0:18:31.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们喝酒了吗?  我们在喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you guys doing? Getting some wine in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.19,0:18:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续唱  我喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you keep singing some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬他与他的新娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sing somethin' for him.
