Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.87,0:34:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么好说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing worth bragging about.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.88,0:34:56.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对于劳力工作有没有兴趣?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you be interested in some sort of manual labor?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.88,0:35:00.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不反对实在的劳力工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got nothing against honest manual labor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.89,0:35:05.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我比较喜欢像你一样坐着上班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just that l'd like to see if I could make a living sitting down like you're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.89,0:35:07.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我老实说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I be honest?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.89,0:35:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人会让你作文书的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's going to offer you an office job.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.90,0:35:11.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竞争太厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's too much competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.90,0:35:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么不去比赛拳击?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.90,0:35:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在那里看到你是个很棒的拳手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read you're a very good fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.90,0:35:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.91,0:35:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的脸可以在一夜之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was you ever punched in the face 500 times a night?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.90,0:35:28.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被打个500下吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stings after a while, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.91,0:35:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢你抽空会谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much for your time. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.92,0:35:44.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包波亚先生?  是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Balboa,   Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.92,0:35:46.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  我们没有空位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very sorry. We have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.92,0:35:50.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗?  下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure? Next
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.93,0:35:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现实点  你没有高中证明不合格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, pal, you gotta be realistic. You got no high-school diploma no qualifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.93,0:35:55.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你难道不会对一份待遇佳的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't you be more content
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.92,0:36:00.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苦力工作感到更满意吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a good-paying menial labor job?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.94,0:36:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要的话可得到其他工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way I see it is I can get another job if I wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.94,0:36:12.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想做很不开心的事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But do I wanna? Do l wanna be doing something l ain't gonna be happy doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.94,0:36:15.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在需要钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus, you know, we need the money now, Butkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.94,0:36:20.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗不会了解我的困难  过来点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dogs don't wanna hear my problems. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.95,0:36:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候我还真希望我是狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I was a canine sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.95,0:36:25.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来亲我一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.95,0:36:27.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一的工作是搬运牛肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only job I got's lugging beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.95,0:36:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有更好的职位吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have nothin' better for Rocky than hauling beef?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.95,0:36:33.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么办  洛奇  假如你要工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all I got,and we're cutting back,too.if you want to work,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.95,0:36:35.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就要一周一周算钱  可以吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it'll be from week to week, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.95,0:36:38.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好呀  我什么时候可开始上班?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's okay with me, but when can I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.96,0:36:40.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.96,0:36:42.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about today?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.96,0:36:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好呀  今天货刚到  太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we got a load coming in. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.96,0:36:46.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保罗  你看起来很瘦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie, you look kinda skinny there!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.96,0:36:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀  他的体重减轻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's losing weight, ain't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.97,0:36:50.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别想法子来谢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bother to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.97,0:36:52.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks a lot, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.97,0:36:55.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不必为手表来谢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, you don't have to thank me for the watch either.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.03,0:38:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我今天里看到最顺眼的事物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's the best-looking thing l've seen all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.03,0:38:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来累极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.03,0:38:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我的脸看起来有倦容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, my face is tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.04,0:38:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我觉得还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.04,0:38:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要去洗个澡?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to take a hot bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.04,0:38:34.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  我觉得精力充足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, come on. I feel dynamic, honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.04,0:38:36.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  明天...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.04,0:38:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我下班以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was thinking at work maybe after work
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.04,0:38:40.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带你出去吃饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.05,0:38:43.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要玩一玩?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna do something nice, huh? You want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.05,0:38:46.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的肚子怎么样了?  - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How's your stomach?  - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.04,0:38:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来很好  你知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look great. You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.05,0:38:53.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你看起来累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look tired, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.09,0:39:46.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们好像是老朋友了  不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're just like old friends, ain't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.09,0:39:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀  老朋友从没有这么有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old friends never tasted this good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.09,0:39:50.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听过这种话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard that!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.10,0:40:01.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.10,0:40:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You Rocky
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.10,0:40:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找我吗?  法蓝克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted me, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.10,0:40:11.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  我不得不解雇你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roky, I gotta let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.11,0:40:13.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事?  我很卖力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come? I'm working hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.11,0:40:14.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我作得不错呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm doing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.11,0:40:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real good,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.11,0:40:17.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们得裁员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we gotta cut back on manpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.11,0:40:19.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你才来上班不久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't got enough time in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.12,0:40:22.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,年资问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's seniority.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.12,0:40:26.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如我自动减薪怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about if I take a cut in pay, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.12,0:40:29.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法  这是工会的规定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't do it. Union rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.12,0:40:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,规定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rules, rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.12,0:40:37.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天作完可以吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can l finish out the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.12,0:40:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然  洛奇  我觉得很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure. Rocky, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.13,0:40:44.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.14,0:40:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你经验比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got more stories than a book, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.14,0:40:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布  这是我的妹婿  洛奇给我五块钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's my brother-in-law, Rocky. Give me the five!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.15,0:41:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的妹婿快过来见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother-in-law came to visit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.14,0:41:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的工作怎么样?  好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you? How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.14,0:41:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你的老家?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking over your old stomping ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.15,0:41:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要买这部车?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie, you wanna buy this car?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.15,0:41:13.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你会喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.15,0:41:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用不上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, I don't need it no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.15,0:41:17.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的眼不好  右转常有困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a hard time making these right turns with my bad eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.15,0:41:21.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我老是撞到垃圾桶之类的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I keep hitting trash cans and things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.16,0:41:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有家庭问题吗?  需要帮忙吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got problems at home? Need bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.16,0:41:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  一切都很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.16,0:41:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这部车很适合你用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, this car'd look great wrapped around you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.16,0:41:31.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如你需要救济的话我可帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if you need a handout, I'll give you a handout.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.17,0:41:33.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我不要救济品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need no handout, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.17,0:41:36.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要买这部车?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you wanna buy the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.16,0:41:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.16,0:41:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么不聪明点再去比赛拳击?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, why don't you be smart and fight again?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.17,0:41:44.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再也不要去比赛拳击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's okay, I don't need to fight no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.17,0:41:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要买部车?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, you wanna buy the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.17,0:41:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且立刻付款?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna pick up the payments?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.17,0:41:49.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的妹妹是不是找你的麻烦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sister giving you a hard time?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.18,0:41:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如是的话  我要打断她的牙齿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, if she is, you break her teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.18,0:41:58.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢她的牙齿  你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate the advice,Paulie,but I kinda like her teeth where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.18,0:42:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己买部车吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here ya go, you bought yourself a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.19,0:42:03.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一部好车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good car, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.19,0:42:07.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了安全你得扣上安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta buckle up for safety and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.19,0:42:12.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要上那儿去?  要搭便吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you going? You need a lift?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.19,0:42:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.20,0:42:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨  替我向我的老妹问好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say hi to my sister for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.20,0:42:32.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们假如需要车子  尽管说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, if you two need the car, just ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.21,0:42:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你在上班  何时回家的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did you get home? I thought you were at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.21,0:42:48.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.21,0:42:51.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不再去上班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't at work no more. l got...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.22,0:42:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天被解雇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got canned today.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.22,0:42:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事?  - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened?  - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.23,0:43:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们正在裁员  那是经济问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was nobody's fault.They were just cutting back.You know,it was economics.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.23,0:43:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你打算怎么办?  - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What're you gonna do?  - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.23,0:43:11.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想拳击比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was thinking about fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.24,0:43:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的眼怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about your eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.24,0:43:16.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生说过你再也不能比赛拳击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doctor said you shouldn't fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.24,0:43:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  他建议我不要比拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He recommended I don't fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.24,0:43:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我自己觉得可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I recommend that l do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.24,0:43:23.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会失明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can go blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.24,0:43:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人会失明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's going blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.24,0:43:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  我的视力很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honest, I see great.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.24,0:43:30.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以像小猎犬一样好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I see like a beagle or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.25,0:43:34.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除此之外你想当什么都可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could be whatever you wanna be. You don't have to fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.25,0:43:37.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是拳手  虽然不大好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I am a fighter. Not too good,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.25,0:43:40.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是那是我的本行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.26,0:43:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你答应过不再比拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, you gave me your word you wouldn't fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.26,0:43:48.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如需要的话  我可以去找事作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, if we need, I could get a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.27,0:43:53.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不必那样作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.26,0:43:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以作原来的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sure. I can get my job back,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.26,0:44:01.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在猫狗店里兼差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know, part time, at the pet shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.27,0:44:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过  应该由我来负担家计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm the one who's supposed to support.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.28,0:44:14.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是短期性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.28,0:44:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如你被传染上那一种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, what if you catch some
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.28,0:44:18.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动物的传染病时  那该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pet-shop disease or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.28,0:44:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们不会生传染病的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There're no pet-shop diseases, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.29,0:44:24.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  我真的想去工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, I wanna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.29,0:44:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的那么想吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really wanna do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.28,0:44:30.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  我们需要钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.29,0:44:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它迟早总是有用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.29,0:44:38.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you're right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.29,0:44:43.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道怎么做最好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what's best.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.30,0:44:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能不能准备吃晚饭?  我饿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling,could you start dinner? I'm starting to get a little hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.31,0:44:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过  我得先完成才行  好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanna finish my workout here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.31,0:44:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.31,0:45:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁呀?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell is there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.32,0:45:14.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅芳的女业务员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Avon lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.36,0:46:16.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁呀?  洛奇?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that? Rocky?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.36,0:46:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不记得给过你锁匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember giving you no key.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.36,0:46:23.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来没那么不好  对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't look so bad, do you, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.37,0:46:24.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.37,0:46:26.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带个外太空的怪物来找我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An outer-space monster you brought me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.37,0:46:29.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是布可斯  你耳里装的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's Butkus, my large dog. What's that in your ear there?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.38,0:46:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,装这个  我可以听得清楚些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that? I hear stupid things better.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.38,0:46:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是带那只狗来给我看的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well now, did you come here to show me that dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.38,0:46:38.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  米奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mickey,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.38,0:46:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不可以要回我的箱子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can I have my locker back?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.39,0:46:41.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在想什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? What's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.39,0:46:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.38,0:46:46.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳击?  你想变失明?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fighting? What? Do you wanna go blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.38,0:46:50.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人会变失明  我眼好得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's going blind. Now you heard what I said? And the eye's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.39,0:46:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.39,0:46:53.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个拳手都以为他还有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, every pug thinks he has
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.39,0:46:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一次好比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one good one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.39,0:46:58.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了吧  你的拳击生涯已经过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now forget it because your fighting career is over, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.39,0:47:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真的吗?  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that right?  - I think that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.40,0:47:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我花了一辈子的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I spend my whole life getting a career.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.40,0:47:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你居然告诉我说已成过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get one and you tell me it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.40,0:47:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这重要吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.40,0:47:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把世届拳王的宝座都给弄丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shook the hell out of the champion of the whole wide world.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.41,0:47:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你高兴了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be happy with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.41,0:47:13.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许这次可以表现得更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we can do better this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.41,0:47:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者更不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or worse. What about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.41,0:47:17.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  米奇  我上次帮过你的忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, Mick. I've done you a favor last time, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.40,0:47:22.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这次是否可以帮帮我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you do me one this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.41,0:47:23.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.41,0:47:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不了解我  我要试试你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand me. I wanna show you something now. Test you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.41,0:47:30.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在看看我的鼻尖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you look, right there, at the end of my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.42,0:47:33.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要试你的是看你的鼻尖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna test you. Look at your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.42,0:47:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的手指一举起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, when I bring my finger in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.42,0:47:37.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就告诉我  好吗? 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tell me when you see it, will yo?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.42,0:47:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's the little thing. I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.43,0:47:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.43,0:47:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就说过没问题吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you it was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.43,0:47:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  现在试试另外一只眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Now we try the other lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.43,0:47:49.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这边  好  现在告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, look here, will you? Now tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.43,0:47:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.43,0:47:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你什么也没看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you see nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.43,0:47:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克利将会毁了你的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creed would've caved in the whole side of your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.43,0:47:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了吧  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, forget it, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.43,0:47:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只有那种心意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.44,0:48:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你已经没有这能力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you ain't got the tools no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.44,0:48:04.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.44,0:48:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.44,0:48:08.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is right.  Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.44,0:48:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许因为你从未达到目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's you who ain't got it no more, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.45,0:48:20.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你甚至连看到的机会都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now look, you didn't even see that coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.46,0:48:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有吗?  没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did you? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.46,0:48:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因为有我这样一个 不好的拳击教练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was from a broken-down pug like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.45,0:48:30.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你猜拳王会怎样对付你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think the champ would do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.46,0:48:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我打得很惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, hurt me bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.46,0:48:39.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  他会让你从此完蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he'd hurt you permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.47,0:48:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Permanent!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.47,0:48:50.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如我不能再参加拳击比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can't fight no more
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.48,0:48:54.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那或许我可以在这里帮帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then maybe l can help out around here, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.48,0:48:57.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里?  当然可以  不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here? Sure, but
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.48,0:49:00.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里高高在上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you're like royalty here, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.48,0:49:02.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你难道想让那些家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want those guys to see
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.48,0:49:07.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到你提着水桶到处去服侍拳手?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you carrying towels and buckets around? Where's your dignity?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.48,0:49:13.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how to say this, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.49,0:49:18.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是非这样不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just I gotta be around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.50,0:49:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.50,0:49:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明天再来好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you come back tomorrow, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.51,0:49:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米奇  谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks a lot, Mick.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.52,0:49:57.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.52,0:50:01.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然是我在推动这场拳击赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know about anybody else,but since I'm gonna be promoting the fight myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.53,0:50:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要施点压力再重比一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want a lot more pressure put on for a rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.53,0:50:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比赛得前二名都可以获得相同钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can get the same money for the two top contenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.53,0:50:08.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要找包波亚比赛呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why go after Balboa? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.52,0:50:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为很多人都认为他赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because there's still a lot of people out there that think he won.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.53,0:50:15.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骂我说先买通比赛的胜负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a lot of people accusing me of having the fight fixed
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.53,0:50:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在学校侮辱我的小孩们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}accusing me of being a fake,and insulting my kids at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.53,0:50:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原因就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.53,0:50:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想不想知道实情?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna hear the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.54,0:50:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我是想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna hear the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.54,0:50:24.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上是上回他狗运好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is he was damn lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.54,0:50:26.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他已经毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he's all finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.54,0:50:29.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他六个月来都没事作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, he's been hanging around doing nothing for six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.55,0:50:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何好的教练绝不会去训练他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And any trainer worth anything wouldn't have nothing to do with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.55,0:50:35.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.55,0:50:37.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们再选其他新拳手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go after some new meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.55,0:50:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别去管这无赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget this bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.56,0:50:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看我是否把他击败了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think l beat him the last time? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.55,0:50:45.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己决定吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.55,0:50:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是赢了  不过我并没有打败他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I won, but I didn't beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.56,0:50:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怕什么?  汤尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you afraid of, Tony?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.56,0:50:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honest?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.56,0:50:59.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  老实讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.57,0:51:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们看他没有一个地方顺眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's all wrong for us, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.57,0:51:09.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打那家伙  我从来就没有看过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw you beat that man
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.58,0:51:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别人像他那样的挨打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like I never saw no man get beat before.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.58,0:51:17.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而那家伙却对你紧迫不舍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the man kept coming after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.57,0:51:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的生活中不需要那种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need that kind of man in our life.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.58,0:51:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我了解你的感受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you're feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.58,0:51:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随他去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.59,0:51:35.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随他去吧  你仍旧是拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let it go! You're the champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.59,0:51:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.60,0:51:42.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你负责我的公共关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in charge of my public relations, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.60,0:51:44.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公开活动整整这家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want a new campaign started.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.60,0:51:47.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要杀杀他的锐气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want something done publicly to bring this man out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.60,0:51:52.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让大家去议论他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want something done to jar this man's pride.to get the people around him talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.60,0:51:56.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如我们使用这种侮辱手段.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You realize if we use this humiliation tactic
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.60,0:51:58.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你等于是在自败名声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're setting yourself up as the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.60,0:52:01.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好  不论用什么手段 总要使他再上拳场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, man, whatever gets him in the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.62,0:52:29.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.63,0:52:31.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看吧  什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.63,0:52:36.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了  什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard me. What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.63,0:52:41.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(意大利种马没种)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.64,0:52:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得很有趣吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's kinda funny, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.66,0:53:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇可  笑什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chico, listen. What's with the grin?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.66,0:53:22.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你开心什么?  我告诉你一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you get so happy with yourself? Let me tell ya something.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.67,0:53:23.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多叫一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snarl more, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.67,0:53:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来个大叫可占点心理上的优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now a good snarl can give you what the Bible calls a psychological edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.67,0:53:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打时大叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because ya snarl on your punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.68,0:53:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  洛奇  过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Rocky! Come here a minute, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.67,0:53:36.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来告诉这个拉丁呆子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show this Latin lamebrain
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.67,0:53:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样叫和怎样出拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how to snarl and punch. Show him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.68,0:53:42.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it, you see!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.68,0:53:46.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真不好看  那就是叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's ugly! That's a snarl.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.68,0:53:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰  你把这水桶倒一下好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John will ya empty them buckets? They're flowing over. Will you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.69,0:53:50.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰  让我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.69,0:53:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.69,0:53:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去  没关系  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it, Rocky. Come on, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.69,0:53:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.70,0:54:03.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.70,0:54:07.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you can take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.69,0:54:12.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你除了会应声以外 没有其他有力一点的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you think of anything tougher to say than ''whoops''?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.70,0:54:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快打呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Chink, hit that right. Bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.72,0:54:41.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好吗?  汤尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.72,0:54:44.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好吗? 不  应该是问你好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How am l doing? No, how are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.72,0:54:47.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来这不干净地方干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're ya doing? Give it to me straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.72,0:54:50.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作  挣点钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, sweeping. Making a few bucks here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.73,0:54:54.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你又不是工友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't no janitor, Rocky. You don't need a job like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.73,0:54:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此外  你又是意大利人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, you're ltalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.43,0:54:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样好了  你回来替我工作洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you come back and work for me, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.73,0:55:01.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要作什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would l be doing? You mean like...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.74,0:55:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收帐或什么的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}collecting or something? What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.74,0:55:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在码头工作可以呼吸新鲜空气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come back, work on the docks, get some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.74,0:55:08.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿发臭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It stinks in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.74,0:55:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤尼  谢谢你的好意  不过...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, l appreciate the offer, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.75,0:55:14.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没办法再作那种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do that stuff no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.74,0:55:17.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样是卫生的  我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's healthy, huh? Look, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.74,0:55:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轻松点  拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy, huh, champ?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.75,0:55:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.75,0:55:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得那家伙吗?  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember that guy, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.75,0:55:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,店内的各动物可好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's everybody in the clubhouse tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.77,0:55:53.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  你今天过的怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. How'd your day go?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.77,0:55:55.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无数的嘲笑  你要不要帮忙?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A million laughs. You know, it was great. You need some help with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.77,0:55:57.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.  Yes, ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.77,0:55:59.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know Adrian,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.78,0:56:01.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你应该呆在家里 让肚子休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l was thinking maybe you oughta stay home and rest your stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.78,0:56:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是兼差而已  我们需要钱用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Rocky, it's just part time. We need the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.78,0:56:07.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.78,0:56:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.79,0:56:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不合我的口味  我喜欢吃麦片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ain't my brand, huh? I like oatmeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.79,0:56:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在跟我回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, why don't we forget all this work?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.79,0:56:20.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家路上  我讲一些笑话给你听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell ya a few jokes on the way home and maybe you'll laugh,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.80,0:56:24.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的生活需要一点欢笑  对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a few laughs in our life. What do ya think? Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.79,0:56:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.79,0:56:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吧?  好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe. Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.79,0:56:30.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's get outta here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.80,0:56:31.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.80,0:56:33.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  听听这个笑话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Adrian Listen to this one:
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.80,0:56:35.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么牛要戴玲?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do cows wear bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.80,0:56:36.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.80,0:56:38.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他们的角不能用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because their horns don't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.80,0:56:43.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那有没有笑死你?  没有吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that killing you? No? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.81,0:56:45.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人三年级时都会喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody liked it in third grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.81,0:56:50.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都笑死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to break everybody up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.82,0:56:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的打扫工作的确作得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really sweep good, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.81,0:56:59.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在跟你讲话吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he talking to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.82,0:57:04.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定把我错认成别人 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has me mixed up with somebody else. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.82,0:57:09.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意大利小鸡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Italian chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.19,0:57:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们甲鱼的生活愉快悠闲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys got the easy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.19,0:57:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天有没有什么变动的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you guys doing? Did anybody move today, you know? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.19,0:57:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的生活好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's life in the bowl?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.20,0:57:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不时要运动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta exercise once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.20,0:57:24.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃些点心怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like a little snack, a little something?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.20,0:57:26.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克夫  过来  哈罗  林克.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Cuff. Hello, Link,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.20,0:57:29.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沉在水里干吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what are you drowning down there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.21,0:57:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要听电视新闲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna hear some TV, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.22,0:57:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴可斯 到这儿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here, Butkus. Come here, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.22,0:57:49.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天作了什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you do today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.23,0:57:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天有没有叫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you bark at anybody today?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.23,0:57:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Adrian,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.23,0:57:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得布可斯是只反常的狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sometimes I look at Butkus. I don't think he's a normal canine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.23,0:57:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为它是什么?  不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you think he is? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.24,0:58:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是看起来不像只正常的狗...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's just don't look like a regular dog sometimes when I look inside there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.24,0:58:07.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去过阿波罗·奎迪豪华体育馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earlier today, I was down at Apollo Creed's palatial gym
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.24,0:58:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像往常一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as usual,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.25,0:58:12.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世届拳王提起洛奇·巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the world champion was not at a loss for words about Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.25,0:58:15.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人都想要我重新再比赛一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know a lot of people wanna see me
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.25,0:58:18.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟一位胆小鬼叫意大利种马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a rematch with a timid fellow who calls himself "The ltalian Stallion."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.25,0:58:22.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这个人不配跟我在拳场相会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this man does not have the honor to meet me in the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.26,0:58:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇退休了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa did officially retire.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.26,0:58:24.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your name, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.26,0:58:27.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那无赖汉藏起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bum's hiding. The bum's running.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.26,0:58:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不敢面对我  他害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't wanna face me. He's scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.27,0:58:33.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从那次不一致的判决获胜之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been under close scrutiny ever since that split-decision victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.27,0:58:35.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经过仔细的考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think there's more here than meets the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.27,0:58:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一些记者们  包括我在内.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of reporters, including me,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.27,0:58:39.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都认为应该是平手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thought it was an even draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.28,0:58:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's your opinion, you're entitled to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.28,0:58:43.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我现在已经准备好再赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now I'm ready to have a rematch
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.28,0:58:45.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来证明这幸运的拳手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to prove that this lucky club-fighter, that's what he is
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.28,0:58:47.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并没有什么技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}does not have the skill
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.28,0:58:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能跟我这样一位优秀的运动员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to last five minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.29,0:58:51.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在拳场比赛五分钟以上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the ring with a superior athlete like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.29,0:58:53.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人不愿面对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man's running. The man's hiding. The man doesn't wanna face me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.29,0:58:56.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  无论你是叫洛奇·巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So l say to you, Rocky Balboa,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.29,0:58:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或其他的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or whatever your name is
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.29,0:59:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让美国人和全世届的人知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I want the American people to know I want the whole world to know
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.30,0:59:02.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我随时准备好向你挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I'm ready,willing and able to meet you anywhere,anyplace,anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.30,0:59:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将把所谓的拳击斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll meet and defeat this so-called fighter...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.30,0:59:07.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自封为意大利种马的人击倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who calls himself "The ltalian Stallion."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.30,0:59:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如他有胆量的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the man only has the guts to give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.31,0:59:12.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可以打电话给我  我付帐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you can call me collect. Call me, Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.31,0:59:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳手付挨拳者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This would be a legitimate rematch the boxer against the puncher,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.31,0:59:17.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信每个人都希望看到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and l think everyone wants to see them
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.31,0:59:19.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重返拳场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back in the ring together.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.32,0:59:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过  只有一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's only one problem:
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.32,0:59:24.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇·巴尔博亚在那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Rocky Balboa?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.32,0:59:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是什么好东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No-good bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.33,0:59:37.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想  我不应该去作广告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I was thinking that I ain't supposed to do no commercials
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.33,0:59:42.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且  我也不应该去肉店上班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I ain't supposed to work in no meat house.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.34,0:59:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该去打拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm supposed to be a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.34,0:59:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你已经不再比拳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you gave that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.35,0:59:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又变得默默无闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'm becoming a nobody again, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.35,0:59:56.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在谁的眼里?  我可不这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In whose eye? Not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.35,1:00:01.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我的脑子里  这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In mine. In here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.36,1:00:07.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们会渡过的  - 只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll get by.  - That's just it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.36,1:00:10.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不愿意艰苦过活  你知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want just to get by the hard way, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.37,1:00:12.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你用好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to have good things.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.37,1:00:14.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要小孩子也用好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the kid to have good things.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.37,1:00:17.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们总会有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.37,1:00:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为现在就需要  不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just think we need them now. Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.38,1:00:24.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.38,1:00:28.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你用不着证明什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to prove anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.38,1:00:31.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  我就只懂这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian, it's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.39,1:00:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要你去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.39,1:00:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就只懂这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.40,1:00:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.40,1:00:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.40,1:00:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来没有要求过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never asked you
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.41,1:00:52.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请别让我当个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to stop being a woman, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.41,1:00:53.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}please.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.41,1:00:55.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm asking you, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.41,1:01:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要叫我别作男人  拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ask me to stop being a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.45,1:01:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们得把他除掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we oughta knock his block off.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.45,1:01:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.46,1:01:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.47,1:01:53.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就这做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.47,1:01:54.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.47,1:01:56.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是重赛的地点已经选好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has a site been chosen for the rematch?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.47,1:01:58.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在费城的史贝川\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This fight will be held in the Philadelphia Spectrum.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.47,1:02:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让他的老乡来看这场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I want this man's home town to see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.48,1:02:04.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要所有费城的人  所有美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want all of Philadelphia. I want all of America,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.48,1:02:06.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,及全世届的人来看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the whole world
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.48,1:02:08.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要在二个回合内就把他击倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see me destroy this man after two short rounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.48,1:02:12.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把他所剩余的躯体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after this fight,he's gonna have to donate what's gonna be left of his body to science.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.49,1:02:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作科学用途  我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there won't be much. That, I can guarantee.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.49,1:02:18.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对史贝川拳赛有何感想?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what do you think about the fight taking place in the Spectrum?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.49,1:02:21.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我觉得很高兴  - 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm very happy about that.  - Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.50,1:02:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离我家只有十分钟的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only about 10 minutes from my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.50,1:02:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说你头一次比赛败在左拳之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of people say you lost the fight, a victim of the Southpaw Jinx.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.50,1:02:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会怕左拳手吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did fighting a left-hander throw you off?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.51,1:02:32.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左拳手没有什么了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Southpaw Jinx nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.51,1:02:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我上回出手太轻了  算他好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time,I took the fight too lightly and this man was just plain lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.51,1:02:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这一次  你们就会看到.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this time, you all will see
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.51,1:02:41.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的阿波罗·奎迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the real Apollo Creed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.52,1:02:43.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闪电般的快速  让你无法招架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world's gonna see the real Apollo. Lightning fast and hard to catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.52,1:02:47.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是玩玩的  而是真的比划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No playing, no jiving. Just business.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.52,1:02:48.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.52,1:02:52.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这次对抗阿波罗可有胜算?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do you think you have a chance this time against Apollo?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.53,1:02:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道  他看起来很生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. He looks pretty mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.53,1:02:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟米奇  我们会尽力就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and Mick, we're gonna try our best.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.53,1:03:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到他被判出局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His lungs he's gonna punch out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.54,1:03:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谁?  美国无赖?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now who's that, Al Capone?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.54,1:03:05.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才懒的理你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't sweat you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.54,1:03:09.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许多人可能不喜欢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of people may not like me and that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.55,1:03:11.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过没关系十一月的时候再来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But come November,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.55,1:03:14.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗·奎迪会提供最大的感恩节奇观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo Creed will provide the ultimate gala spectacle on Thanksgiving,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.55,1:03:16.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他的众乡亲之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in front of this man's home crowd
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.55,1:03:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要像革除坏习惯一样的除掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna drop him like a bad habit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.56,1:03:21.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你打算怎样运用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, your pay for the fight is very substantial.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.56,1:03:23.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拳击赢来的大笔奖金?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you gonna do with the money? Yes, what're you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.56,1:03:27.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一  我得付房租\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First thing I gotta do is, I gotta pay the rent, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.56,1:03:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要购物的单子上有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then,I made this list on the way over and I was just thinking of things to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.57,1:03:36.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几顶帽子  一部摩托车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to get a couple of hats, a motorcycle and
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.57,1:03:38.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几瓶香水给艾莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a couple of quarts of perfume, for Adrian.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.57,1:03:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她喜欢香香的味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She likes to smell good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.58,1:03:43.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一些玩具  像安尼和大鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And some Muppet toys, you know. Ernie and Big Bird
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.58,1:03:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有那只青蛙  叫什么  可米特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that frog. What's his name, Kermit?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.59,1:03:51.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还要送给教堂一座刻像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought maybe a statue for the Church and
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.59,1:03:56.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一个制冰机给保罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think a snow-cone machine for you, Paulie.You like snow cones,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.59,1:04:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  有什么话要批评拳王的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, got anything derogatory to say about the champ?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.60,1:04:03.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,批评?  有  他很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Derogatory? Yeah, he's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.60,1:04:05.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来几张小丑照片怎样?  阿波罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about some clowning shots, Apollo?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.60,1:04:10.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们觉得这像是个马戏团吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this look like a circus to you, man?!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.61,1:04:15.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十一月再来  你就是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come November, you're mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.61,1:04:20.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's very upset.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.62,1:04:27.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看出他怎样出手打你的眼吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See how he bumps that jab into your eye?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.62,1:04:29.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.63,1:04:32.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有勇气重回拳场跟他较量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got guts to go back in the ring with him, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.63,1:04:36.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks a lot, Mick.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.63,1:04:39.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的招式很容易看出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your style's too easy to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.64,1:04:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左拳手是最不好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left-handed fighters, they're the worst.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.64,1:04:43.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多半都会打到脸.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They lead with their face mostly,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.64,1:04:45.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非得改掉那致命的左拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gotta throw that big left.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.64,1:04:47.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,规定一点也不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The right's no damn good.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.64,1:04:50.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们应该禁止用左拳比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They oughta outlaw southpaws.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.65,1:04:52.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么以前都不告诉我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you tell me this before?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.65,1:04:56.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想伤你的心  现在看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't wanna hurt your feelings. Now, look
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.65,1:05:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得创造奇绩  必须改掉旧习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta pull this miracle off. You gotta change everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.66,1:05:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得学用右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta learn to be a right-handed fighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.66,1:05:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样会让阿波罗弄不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this'll confuse Apollo
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.66,1:05:08.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事  也可乘机保护眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it'll protect that bad eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.66,1:05:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再也没办法学用右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I can't learn how to fight right-handed no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.67,1:05:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么叫不能  没有不能的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's can't? There ain't no can'ts! There's no can'ts!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.67,1:05:18.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会把你打得比现在还要  惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he will beat you uglier than you are now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.67,1:05:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始练右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now listen, you start fighting right-handed
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.68,1:05:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你在突然之间改变拳路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then ya change sudden
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.68,1:05:24.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以重写拳史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that'll make history.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.68,1:05:26.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我们首先要练速度.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But first, we gotta get speed,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.68,1:05:29.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞快的速度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}demon speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.69,1:05:33.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要敏捷 快速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speed's what we need.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.69,1:05:34.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need greasy, fast speed!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.69,1:05:36.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸡是怎样用它的二条腿来跑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I show you a trick how to get some speed in them legs.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.69,1:05:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要穿那件发臭的汗衣?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to wear that stinking sweatshirt?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.69,1:05:40.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它可以给我带来好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It brings me luck, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.70,1:05:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那会招惹苍蝇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what it brings? It brings flies.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.70,1:05:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now listen, I want ya to try Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.70,1:05:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你试着去追这只小鸡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to try to chase this little chicken.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.70,1:05:50.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要追小鸡?  真难为情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do I gotta chase a chicken for? It's embarrassing, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.71,1:05:52.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我说要就是要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, because I said so.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.71,1:05:54.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追鸡这个项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And second, because chicken-chasing
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.71,1:05:57.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们常常用来当作一种训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is how we always used to train in the old days.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.71,1:06:00.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是追的上它  你可比美光速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You catch this thing, you can catch greased lightning.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.72,1:06:02.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我宁愿吃也不愿意去追它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather eat it than chase it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.72,1:06:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来的好像不够成熟.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't mature, but all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.72,1:06:06.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也一样不成熟  去追吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither are you very mature!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.72,1:06:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是拳手  不是农夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a fighter. I ain't a farmer.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.72,1:06:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  快抓它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on at it! Go on and get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.73,1:06:12.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓它  抓它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him, get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.73,1:06:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么搞的?  快抓呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you? Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.73,1:06:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  你怎么了?  抓住它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! What's the matter with you? Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.73,1:06:21.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓起来  抓起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick him up! Pick him up!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.74,1:06:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull him around!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.74,1:06:26.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么这么慢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter? You're so fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.74,1:06:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你站住啦?  快呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are your standards still speed, speed!?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.74,1:06:30.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连小鸡都抓不住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you catch a little chicken?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.75,1:06:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快动呀  动呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.75,1:06:35.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别停下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move your tail!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.75,1:06:39.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么弄的?  像个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like a girl out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.76,1:06:42.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得像是肯塔基来的呆子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like a Kentucky-fried idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.76,1:06:44.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒好吗?  醒醒  快呀  打呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, will you? Will you wake up?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.76,1:06:47.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  洛奇我妹妹是怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with my sister?
