Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.10,1:12:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当他需要你的协助时?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while you're ditching the guy when he needs your help?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.10,1:12:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我耳朵听到的是这样吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe my ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.11,1:12:32.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么都没有教我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't teach me anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.11,1:12:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来没有伤过洛奇的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I never hurt Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.11,1:12:36.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在扰乱他的神志  你不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're messing up his brain real bad. Do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.11,1:12:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保罗  你在说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not what I'm doing. I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.11,1:12:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别那样说对我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't telI me!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.11,1:12:41.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会因为你而受罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna get hurt because of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.12,1:12:44.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要那样说  那不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't true. Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.12,1:12:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm saying it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.12,1:12:47.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去告诉他没有关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come across and tell him it's alI right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.12,1:12:48.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好  保罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not alI right, Paulie!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.12,1:12:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如他变失明  你就可以不管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he goes blind, you walk away.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.13,1:12:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我作不到  我爱他  你不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't. I love him, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.13,1:13:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.14,1:13:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么呢?  到底那边不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you doing? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.14,1:13:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  你是怎么搞的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.14,1:13:10.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  你的勇气呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, where're your guts?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.15,1:13:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么问题?  米奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your problem, Mick?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.15,1:13:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的问题?  是你有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My problem? You got a problem, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.15,1:13:19.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心理问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a ticker problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.15,1:13:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的脑袋一片空白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter? You got nothing left inside, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.16,1:13:25.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么练起来像个无赖一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you're training like a damn bum. You know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.16,1:13:26.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无赖?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bum?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.16,1:13:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  无赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bum!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.16,1:13:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你对  或许我是不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you're right. Maybe I ain't got it no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.17,1:13:36.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  那你就不要浪费我的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then don't you waste my time no more, do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.17,1:13:37.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go away!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.17,1:13:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到你所属的码头去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to the docks where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.17,1:13:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回去当个  无名小卒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll go back to being a two-bit nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.18,1:13:45.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且  你再也不要来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't you ever come back here again
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.18,1:13:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我已经太老了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I'm too old
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.18,1:13:49.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有多余的时间可以浪费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to waste my time
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.18,1:13:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去训练一个像你这样的一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trying to train a no-good loser like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.19,1:13:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,输不起的无赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bum!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.19,1:13:54.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  对街的人找你去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want you across the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.19,1:13:59.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太太病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wife's sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.20,1:14:08.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚先生  我是摪柏医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Balboa, I'm Dr. Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.20,1:14:11.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子虽然早产一个月 不过一切都很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The baby is fine even though it's a month premature.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.21,1:14:12.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.21,1:14:13.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个男孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.21,1:14:16.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没想到她居然生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy smoke, I didn't know she could do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.21,1:14:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉怎么样了?  她在那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's Adrian? Where is Adrian?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.21,1:14:22.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也得了并发症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's had complications.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.22,1:14:23.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那一种?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.22,1:14:24.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太太大量出血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your wife was hemorrhaging
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.22,1:14:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她到医院来的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when she was brought in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.22,1:14:30.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为工作过度而早产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The premature delivery was most likely caused by straining or overwork.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.23,1:14:35.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然失血造成昏迷不醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the sudden loss of blood has caused her to slip into a coma.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.25,1:15:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.27,1:15:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说  你病得很重  不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said you're very sick, but
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.27,1:15:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna believe that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.28,1:15:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你只是劳累而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you're just tired, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.28,1:15:34.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  尽量睡好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about nothing. You just sleep as long as ya want, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.29,1:15:39.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会留在这里等你醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm gonna be here when ya wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.30,1:15:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  算了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.30,1:15:50.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留在这里也没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not doing any good, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.31,1:15:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒不如去看看小孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go see the kid. That's what Adrian would want.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.31,1:15:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我要跟艾莉一起去看他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we gotta see him together.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.31,1:16:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  我们要一起去看他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta see him together.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.33,1:16:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Balboa
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.33,1:16:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,探访时间已过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}visiting hours are over.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.33,1:16:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能留下吗?  我不出声的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, can't I stay? I'll be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.34,1:16:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉  这是医院的规定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. Hospital rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.34,1:16:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在旁边也不会作什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do any more of this watchin' stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.35,1:16:39.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有没有教堂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a chapel?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.35,1:16:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.36,1:16:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.39,1:17:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.39,1:17:22.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是凌晨三点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's three in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.40,1:17:27.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可知道我  去过你家.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that I went up to your house.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.40,1:17:30.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们告诉我 你在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They told me you was here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.41,1:17:35.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是凌晨三点  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's 3:00 a.m., kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.41,1:17:40.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  是个好女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian she's a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.42,1:17:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对你们二人感到遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm sorry for both of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.42,1:17:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帮不上忙  是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing I can do, is there?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.43,1:17:55.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.43,1:17:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一旦说了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to tell you something once,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.43,1:18:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以后就不会再讲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then I ain't gonna say it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.44,1:18:04.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你又有  另一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rock, you got another shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.44,1:18:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是第二次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the second shot
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.44,1:18:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去挑战世届冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the biggest title in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.45,1:18:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你要去交赛…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're gonna be swapping punches
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.45,1:18:23.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和世上最危险的拳手比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the most dangerous fighter in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.46,1:18:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just in case...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.46,1:18:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的脑筋不太清楚.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know, your brain ain't working so good
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.46,1:18:32.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些很快就要面临到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}alI this happens pretty soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.47,1:18:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你若没有准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you ain't ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.47,1:18:39.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定会面目全非\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're nowhere near in shape.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.47,1:18:43.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  我说  看在上帝的份上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I said, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.48,1:18:44.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么不坚强起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you stand up
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.48,1:18:46.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奋力去迎战这家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and fight this guy hard
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.48,1:18:51.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像你以前一样?  那次太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like ya done before?! That was beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.49,1:18:56.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不要像这样躺在他面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't sit down in front of him like this!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.49,1:19:00.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像个呆子一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, I don't know, some kind of mongrel or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.50,1:19:05.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则他会把你的脸打碎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he's gonna kick your face in pieces!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.50,1:19:10.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙不想赢  他只想侮辱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy just don't wanna win. He wants to bury you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.51,1:19:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要向全世届证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to humiliate you. He wants to prove to the whole world
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.51,1:19:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不算什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it was nothing
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.51,1:19:18.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是个首次出现的怪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but some kind of a freak the first time out!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.51,1:19:19.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也说过你只不过是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he said you're
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.51,1:19:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一次运气好的无赖罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a one-time lucky bum!
