Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.15,1:38:39.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.15,1:38:41.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的头痛好了吗?  - 我想好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you ready in here?  - I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.15,1:38:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚是我们之夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight's our night, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.16,1:38:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王开始入场...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the sound of the crowd,the champion is just now coming into the Spectrum.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.16,1:38:48.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冠军阿波罗·奎迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the champion, Apollo Creed.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.16,1:38:53.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他这次看起来更有决心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looks a little more determined this time than he did the last time!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.17,1:38:55.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是阿波罗  - 你想会是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's Apollo.  - Who'd ya expect?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.17,1:39:00.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还希望他不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping he wouldn't show.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.18,1:39:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王现在进到绳圈来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, the champion is climbing into the ring
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.18,1:39:10.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有把握的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}very determined-looking, very serious right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.18,1:39:13.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇看起来不像他有信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky doesn't look as confident as he might.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.19,1:39:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗·奎迪  永恒之王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo Creed, the master of disaster!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.19,1:39:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就要被击倒  你完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You going down, man! You going down!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.20,1:39:27.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别操心  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let it bother you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.20,1:39:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会操心吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't it bother you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.20,1:39:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位先生女士  晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.21,1:39:38.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎到费城的史贝川体育馆来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And welcome to the Philadelphia Spectrum.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.21,1:39:41.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是今晚的大事的拳赛里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the main event of the evening:
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.21,1:39:46.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,15轮  争夺重量级拳王大赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifteen rounds, the Heavyweight Championship of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.22,1:39:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在黑色的角落里是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the black corner,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.23,1:39:57.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挑战者  体重202旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the challenger weighing 202 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.23,1:40:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自拳击之城的费城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the great fighting city of Philadelphia
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.23,1:40:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意大利种马的洛奇·巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ltalian Stallion, Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.25,1:40:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一位世届闻名的拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A champion
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.26,1:40:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不须要我再来介绍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who needs no introduction anywhere in the civilized world.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.26,1:40:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的一位败北的克星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The true master of disaster
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.27,1:40:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一位永击不败的世届重量级拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the undefeated Heavyweight Champion of the world
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.27,1:40:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗·奎迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the one, the only, Apollo Creed.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.28,1:40:52.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裁判现在指示他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Referee Lou Filippo will give the instructions.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.29,1:41:02.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  两位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna give you
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.30,1:41:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比赛规则是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the instructions now.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.30,1:41:06.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望遵守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I expect you to follow them.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.30,1:41:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以攻击腰部以下的部位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your low punches
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.30,1:41:10.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有不可以攻击腰部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and watch your kidney punches.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.30,1:41:11.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不可以由背部击头部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your rabbit punches.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.30,1:41:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如被击倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In case of a knockdown,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.31,1:41:14.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们回到自己的角落去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you go to the corner I tell you to
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.31,1:41:16.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在那里等我口号知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and stay there until I tell you to come out. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.31,1:41:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望比赛圆满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, boys, let's have a good fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.31,1:41:23.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就要倒地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going down.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.32,1:41:28.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.32,1:41:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还在气头上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still upset.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.32,1:41:31.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁理他?  护着那只眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who cares? Now listen, protect that eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.32,1:41:35.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非我叫你  否则不要用左拳打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no matter what happens don't go back to fighting southpaw till I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.33,1:41:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就会打倒他明白吗?  好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you get him, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.33,1:41:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好运  祝好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.33,1:41:39.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想快速把你打倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, he's gonna try to kill you quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.33,1:41:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你能度过第一个回合 那他铁定败在我们手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you get through this first round, then he's ours!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.34,1:41:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他知道你的厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show him who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.34,1:41:53.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇在祈祷  拳王在挥舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa prays in his corner. The champion dancing over in his corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.35,1:41:58.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世纪性的拳赛即将开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just seconds away from the fight of the century, Superfight Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.35,1:42:04.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王快速挥拳进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The champion comes over in a hurry and throws a couple of rights and lefts.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.36,1:42:06.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一开始就占优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He starts to take command early here.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.36,1:42:10.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他努力保持速度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, he's kind of hauling speed around the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.36,1:42:12.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇用右手比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky's holding that right hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.37,1:42:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对付那猛击  他用右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's fighting right-handed.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.37,1:42:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.37,1:42:20.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南费城仔用右手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Southpaw from Philly, he is fighting right-handed!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.38,1:42:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.38,1:42:31.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.39,1:42:36.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛击他呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break that damn jab!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.39,1:42:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保护那只眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protect that eye!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.39,1:42:45.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你全部的本领?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that all you got? You ain't got nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.40,1:42:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要卧下了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready to lay down?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.40,1:42:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是准准的一下右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A go right, a go left.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.40,1:42:51.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是一拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another right and another right!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.40,1:42:54.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狠狠三记右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creed out with a right hand. Take it, Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.41,1:42:56.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇退到角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he's in the corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.41,1:42:58.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左右拳轮番猛烈还击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And those left and right hits are coming back at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.41,1:43:01.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王打中洛奇的头洛奇退到绳上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of lefts and a right to the head.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.41,1:43:03.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇不断被击中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa appears to be getting hit often.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.42,1:43:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过状况好像很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he seems to be in pretty good condition right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.42,1:43:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇好像碰上困难了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa is in trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.42,1:43:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他连连中拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in trouble, taking rights and lefts from the champion.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.42,1:43:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像无力招架了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a tremendous fight
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.43,1:43:23.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇被击倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa is down
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.44,1:43:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗打中他的坏左眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We see Apollo's hit that bad left eye,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.44,1:43:28.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和上一场被打伤的同一只眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}remember,from the first fight?It was the eye that was cut the last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.44,1:43:30.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚站起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa's getting up.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.44,1:43:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宰了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.45,1:43:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追他  追他  好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go after him, kid! Go after him!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.45,1:43:40.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王再度入场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The champion starts to move in again,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.45,1:43:42.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他挥出右拳左拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}throwing rights and lefts
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.46,1:43:46.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚一轮猛攻越过场子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa right into the cord.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.46,1:43:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油  巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.46,1:43:53.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚连中数拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa's tags: Left, left and right combinations by the champion.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.47,1:43:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一回合结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the end of the round.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.47,1:44:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这二人水火不容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a lot of bad blood between these two.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.48,1:44:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一回合打得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good round. Good round.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.48,1:44:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.48,1:44:08.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他又打中我的鼻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He broke my nose again.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.48,1:44:10.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚一定要很壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa's gotta be in great shape
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.48,1:44:13.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才耐得了这种残杀的考验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to withstand that butchering.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.49,1:44:15.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样子  残杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll tell you just what it is, it's a plain old butchering.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.49,1:44:18.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他换只手比赛是否对你不利?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did the switching bother you?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.49,1:44:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该把他制服了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}AlI right, then you should've had him.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.49,1:44:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你因为太忙所以不容易受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can't be hurt, Because you are too tough!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.50,1:44:24.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别放松他  这个人很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, don't let up on this man. This man is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.50,1:44:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他危险  我才危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man is danger! I am dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.50,1:44:29.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That guy's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.50,1:44:31.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  他只是个人而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, he's only a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.50,1:44:32.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以把他击倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can beat him
