Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.93,1:51:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要看住移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stick and move!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.93,1:51:40.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次跟上回不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't gonna be like last time.
