Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.93,1:51:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我不要用左拳耍诈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No tricks, I ain't switching.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.94,1:51:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你就要宣告不支\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're fading out, kid.
