Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.94,1:51:47.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}AlI right! Go with the right.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.94,1:51:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要想想  你得要变一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a plan, you gotta switch, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.94,1:51:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's ready, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.94,1:51:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗  别想击倒  你要逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo, don't go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.95,1:51:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,15回合开始  最后一回合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've come to the center of the ring for the 15th and final round.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.95,1:52:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要倒了  不  绝不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going down. No, no way.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.95,1:52:03.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始  看奎迪的表现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go. Let's see what Creed does here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.96,1:52:07.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一开始奎迪冲向巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creed is starting to move in on Balboa. He's going for the knockdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.96,1:52:12.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王以左拳猛攻不停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The champion comes off jabbing with that left hand. Sticking the left hand out.
