Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.01,1:53:01.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from him!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.01,1:53:03.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会如何  我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they getting it, I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.02,1:53:06.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一记右拳  是奎迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A right hand! A right hand! It's Creed.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.02,1:53:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it's Balboa!
