Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.03,1:53:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油  好呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Good！
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.04,1:53:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky!
