Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.11,1:54:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳王倒下了  他倒了  起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The champ is still on one knee! Get up!
