Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.11,1:54:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你出局了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over! He won! Balboa just legally did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.12,1:54:49.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇·巴尔博亚震惊全世届\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky has shocked the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.12,1:54:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是新的世届重量级拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the new Heavyweight Champion of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.13,1:54:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位先生女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.13,1:55:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出乎意的结果  得胜的一击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a stunning upset scoring the winning-point knockout
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.13,1:55:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的世届重量级拳王洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the new Heavyweight Champion of the world, Rocky
