Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.15,1:55:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不敢相信这是真的  我不敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe this has happened. I can't.
