Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.17,1:55:38.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也爱你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I love you, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.17,1:55:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特别是  我要感谢上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of all, I wanna thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.18,1:55:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了我儿子出世以外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for my kid being born
