Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.19,1:56:01.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  我做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.19,1:56:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你  我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you. I love you.
